#~ msgstr "Privzete nastavitve videza"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "To change a setting globally, tap and hold an <b>option</b> or <b>menu "
#~ "item</b> (font weight, line spacing etc.), to set its value as <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">default</span>. This new value will only be applied to books "
#~ "opened from now on as we said above. Previously opened books will keep "
#~ "their settings. You can identify default values as a <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">star</span> (★) in the menu or as a <span class=\"ui\">black "
#~ "border</span> around the indicators as seen below:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Če želiš nastavitev spremeniti globalno, pritisni in drži <b>možnost</b> "
#~ "ali <b>postavko menija</b> (npr. debelino pisave, razmik med vrsticami "
#~ "itd.), da njeno vrednost nastaviš kot <span class=\"ui\">privzeto</span>. "
#~ "Ta nova vrednost bo veljala le za knjige, ki jih boš odprl od zdaj "
#~ "naprej. Že odprte knjige bodo ohranile svoje nastavitve. Privzete "
#~ "vrednosti prepoznaš po <span class=\"ui\">zvezdici</span> (★) v meniju "
#~ "ali po <span class=\"ui\">črni obrobi</span> okoli indikatorjev, kot je "
#~ "videti spodaj:"

#~ msgid "Applying current defaults to an already opened book"
#~ msgstr "Uveljavljanje privzetih nastavitev v že odprti knjigi"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "So when you adjust your document defaults like <span class=\"ui\">default "
#~ "line spacing</span> or <span class=\"ui\">default contrast</span>, this "
#~ "new value will only be used for the new documents you open after the "
#~ "change. Your already opened books will not change."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ko torej prilagodiš privzete vrednosti (npr. <span class=\"ui\">privzeti "
#~ "razmik med vrsticami</span> ali <span class=\"ui\">privzeti kontrast</"
#~ "span>), bodo te uporabljene le za nove dokumente. Že odprte knjige se ne "
#~ "bodo spremenile."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "But what if you want them to change too? For example, if you change your "
#~ "default <span class=\"ui\">font</span>, you will probably adjust <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">font weight</span> and <span class=\"ui\">line spacing</"
#~ "span> to more suitable values for this new font. You are satisfied with "
#~ "how the text looks and now you want all your books to look like this. "
#~ "With this feature you don’t need to change these values manually in all "
#~ "your opened books."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kaj pa, če želiš spremeniti tudi te? Če na primer zamenjaš privzeto <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">pisavo</span>, boš verjetno prilagodil tudi <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">debelino pisave</span> in <span class=\"ui\">razmik med "
#~ "vrsticami</span>. Ko si z videzom zadovoljen, morda želiš, da tako "
#~ "izgledajo vse tvoje knjige. S to funkcijo ti teh vrednosti ni treba ročno "
#~ "spreminjati v vsaki odprti knjigi posebej."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You can easily apply these changes to your already opened books by "
#~ "choosing:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Te spremembe lahko preprosto uveljaviš v že odprtih knjigah tako, da "
#~ "izbereš:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When you adjust a book to your liking, for example by changing <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">line spacing</span>, <span class=\"ui\">font contrast</span> "
#~ "etc. you can save all the changes at once as <span class=\"ui\">defaults</"
#~ "span>. Then you can apply these settings to other books with the <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">Reset document settings to default</span> option as "
#~ "explained above."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ko knjigo prilagodiš po svojem okusu (npr. spremeniš <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">razmik med vrsticami</span>, <span class=\"ui\">kontrast "
#~ "pisave</span> itd.), lahko vse te spremembe hkrati shraniš kot <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">privzete</span>. Nato jih lahko uveljaviš v drugih knjigah z "
#~ "možnostjo <span class=\"ui\">Ponastavi nastavitve dokumenta na privzete</"
#~ "span>."

#~ msgid "Creating different groups of settings"
#~ msgstr "Ustvarjanje različnih skupin nastavitev"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This powerful feature allows you to save all the <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">BOTTOM MENU</span> settings + font type as a <b>profile</b>. "
#~ "This means you can have different group of settings for different "
#~ "conditions or book types which you can apply at once instead of changing "
#~ "the settings manually every time."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ta zmogljiva funkcija ti omogoča, da vse nastavitve <span "
#~ "class=\"ui\">SPODNJEGA MENIJA</span> in vrsto pisave shraniš kot "
#~ "<b>profil</b>. Tako imaš lahko različne skupine nastavitev za različne "
#~ "pogoje ali vrste knjig, ki jih uveljaviš hkrati, namesto da bi vsakič "
#~ "ročno spreminjal vsako nastavitev posebej."

#~ msgid "For example you can create:"
#~ msgstr "Ustvariš lahko na primer:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<b>Double column</b> profile with <span class=\"ui\">two columns</span> "
