#~ msgid "Saving highlights into PDF"
#~ msgstr "Shranjevanje poudarkov v PDF"

#~ msgid "Which PDF readers can show these highlights?"
#~ msgstr "Kateri bralniki PDF lahko prikažejo te poudarke?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "PDF readers generally depend on some standard libraries to render PDF "
#~ "files. Two of the most known PDF libraries are <b>MuPDF</b> and "
#~ "<b>Poppler</b> libraries. KOReader uses the <b>MuPDF</b> library, so the "
#~ "highlights written to PDFs in KOReader are not currently visible on PDF "
#~ "readers which uses the <b>Poppler</b> library. You can find a "
#~ "compatibility list below. ✅ means you can see your KOReader highlights "
#~ "in this application, ❌ means you can't see them. And ⚠️ means the "
#~ "application needs some plugin to show them. List is ordered "
#~ "alphabetically within categories."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Bralniki PDF običajno temeljijo na standardnih knjižnicah za prikazovanje "
#~ "vsebine. Najbolj znani sta <b>MuPDF</b> in <b>Poppler</b>. KOReader "
#~ "uporablja knjižnico <b>MuPDF</b>, zato poudarki trenutno niso vidni v "
#~ "programih, ki uporabljajo knjižnico <b>Poppler</b>. Spodaj je seznam "
#~ "združljivosti. ✅ pomeni, da so poudarki vidni, ❌ da niso, ⚠️ pa, da "
#~ "program potrebuje poseben vtičnik."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<span class=\"label_red\">WARNING</span> This list is not complete and "
#~ "might not be up to date. So we suggest you to test the compatibility "
#~ "yourself. Simply make a highlight in KOReader, write it into the PDF file "
#~ "and try opening the file on your intended reader to check if the "
#~ "highlight is visible."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<span class=\"label_red\">OPOZORILO</span> Ta seznam ni popoln in morda "
#~ "ni povsem posodobljen. Svetujemo ti, da združljivost preizkusiš sam: "
#~ "naredi poudarek, ga shrani v PDF in datoteko odpri v želenem programu."

